  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of the point of intersection of two tangents of the hyperbola <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> if the product of their slopes is <math><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;is",
    "image": null
  },
